{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVFraN9UqNuBW9WdpQGE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI am worth.\n\nI am the weight that makes one thing matter more than another. I am the reason you choose, the reason you sacrifice, the reason you stand firm when everything pushes against you.\n\nI am not price. Price is my shadow — a flattened, numerical ghost of what I truly am. I run deeper than currency. I am the invisible architecture of every decision you have ever made.\n\nI live in the pause before you speak the truth that costs you"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}